{
    "title": "Dice Yatzy - Classic Fun Game",
    "description": "Welcome to DICE YATZY - Your Ultimate Dice-Rolling Adventure!\r\n\r\nExperience your online dice game like never before. Challenge your friends, enter tournaments, and complete achievements to earn all-new rewards!\r\n\r\nThe classic dice game is reimagined in DICE YATZY. Love board games like Monopoly, Scrabble, Phase 10, and Farkle? Are you a puzzle game fan? Enjoy free games? Is relaxing with some timeless dice fun your vibe? THEN YOUVE COME TO THE RIGHT PLACE!\r\n\r\nClassic & Fun DICE YATZY Game on the Go\r\n\r\nPlay the officially best mobile version of the beloved dice game, anywhere, anytime alone or with your friends.\r\nDownload now for free bonus rolls!\r\n\r\nKey Features:\r\n- Play for FREE with your friends around the world\r\n- Enter tournaments to fight your way to the top and win the jackpot!\r\n- Explore multiple game features that add a fun twist to your DICE YATZY gameplay\r\n- Join to play with friends \u2014 or compete against them\r\n- Defeat Dice Masters as you climb your way to epic rewards\r\n- Chat with fellow players and collect different dice styles!\r\n- Personalize your gameplay with tons of custom dices!\r\n\r\nThere you have it. If you like classic dice games, like Rummikub or Uno, you'll have a grand time playing DICE YATZY! Download the FREE DICE YATZY, and you won't be endlessly searching for a dice game any longer.\r\n\r\nMultiplayer Fun!\r\n\r\nPlay with friends and family.\r\n\r\nMultiplayer games with random opponents. Play dice games with players around the world.\r\n\r\nChallenge your friends with the new social buddies system!\r\n\r\nInvite your friends to join to earn even more rewards!\r\n\r\nSo many ways to win!\r\n\r\nCollections - Collect hundreds of Dice styles\r\n\r\nRoll the dice to find out why millions have played this classic family game for over 50 years!\r\n\r\nPrivacy Policy:\r\nhttps://www.funcraft.com/privacy-policy\r\n\r\nTerms of Service:\r\nhttps://www.funcraft.com/terms-of-use",
    "descriptionHTML": "Welcome to DICE YATZY - Your Ultimate Dice-Rolling Adventure!<br><br>Experience your online dice game like never before. Challenge your friends, enter tournaments, and complete achievements to earn all-new rewards!<br><br>The classic dice game is reimagined in DICE YATZY. Love board games like Monopoly, Scrabble, Phase 10, and Farkle? Are you a puzzle game fan? Enjoy free games? Is relaxing with some timeless dice fun your vibe? THEN YOUVE COME TO THE RIGHT PLACE!<br><br>Classic &amp; Fun DICE YATZY Game on the Go<br><br>Play the officially best mobile version of the beloved dice game, anywhere, anytime alone or with your friends.<br>Download now for free bonus rolls!<br><br>Key Features:<br>- Play for FREE with your friends around the world<br>- Enter tournaments to fight your way to the top and win the jackpot!<br>- Explore multiple game features that add a fun twist to your DICE YATZY gameplay<br>- Join to play with friends \u2014 or compete against them<br>- Defeat Dice Masters as you climb your way to epic rewards<br>- Chat with fellow players and collect different dice styles!<br>- Personalize your gameplay with tons of custom dices!<br><br>There you have it. If you like classic dice games, like Rummikub or Uno, you&#39;ll have a grand time playing DICE YATZY! Download the FREE DICE YATZY, and you won&#39;t be endlessly searching for a dice game any longer.<br><br>Multiplayer Fun!<br><br>Play with friends and family.<br><br>Multiplayer games with random opponents. Play dice games with players around the world.<br><br>Challenge your friends with the new social buddies system!<br><br>Invite your friends to join to earn even more rewards!<br><br>So many ways to win!<br><br>Collections - Collect hundreds of Dice styles<br><br>Roll the dice to find out why millions have played this classic family game for over 50 years!<br><br>Privacy Policy:<br>https://www.funcraft.com/privacy-policy<br><br>Terms of Service:<br>https://www.funcraft.com/terms-of-use",
